# Runtime data directories. These are created by running the server locally, and they
# hold a deployment identity keypair (private key included), the agent and Mastra
# SQLite databases, and the AgentFS workspace database. They are not part of the
# product. Leaving them in shipped a 1.9 MB dev data directory in the published
# image, including a private key — caught by scanning the built image, not by any
# check in the build. Any new data directory added under apps/ belongs here too.
apps/server/papyrus-agent-data
**/papyrus-agent-data

# dev-only assets not needed for the server image
certs
# apps/video is a separate Remotion app, not part of the server — exclude it
# wholesale so the image doesn't pull its ~350 MB dependency tree.
apps/video
